graft-mtp - Athena-4B-MTP
=========================

The model file is a graft of two works. Attribution and license follow.

Base model
----------
xtools-at/Qwen3.5-4B-MultiDistill-3xMerge-UNCENSORED-heretic
  https://huggingface.co/xtools-at/Qwen3.5-4B-MultiDistill-3xMerge-UNCENSORED-heretic
  License: Apache-2.0

Quantization
------------
mradermacher/Qwen3.5-4B-MultiDistill-3xMerge-UNCENSORED-heretic-i1-GGUF
  i1-Q4_K_S. Quantized with llama.cpp's imatrix path.

MTP head (block 32)
-------------------
RBergBauer/Qwen3.5-4B-MTP-Heretic
  https://huggingface.co/RBergBauer/Qwen3.5-4B-MTP-Heretic
  The 15 MTP tensors, grafted at f16. The 7 one-dimensional norms are stored as w + 1, the
  convention the official Qwen converter uses.

